<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:17:27 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>错误不定义你的巫术</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad7f684ee05a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个错误并不能定义你的巫术。如果你在念咒语时忘了念到哪儿，或者把正在编织的绳子缠乱了，你可以停下来再试一次。你是在做一件需要练习的事，而不是在参加考试。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-black and muted rose-pink fantasy scene of a gray-haired witch untangling braided cord at a wooden worktable, with loose cord beside a basket. A round window overlooks green fields and floating islands with a windmill. Warm ivory serif lettering fills the upper wall, and a gold botanical emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: A mistake doesn't define your witchcraft. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad7f684ee05a.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:17:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>自从两个月前楼上的新邻居搬进来后，这是我第一次又能静下心来做一个傻乎乎但很放松的拼图。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad7c89ead6ba</link><description>&lt;p&gt;自从两个月前楼上的新邻居搬进来后，这是我第一次又能静下心来做一个傻乎乎但很放松的拼图。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Point by point book on a green table" height="2160" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/simondh/6ad7c89ead6ba.jpg" width="3840"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://simondh.some.pics"&gt;@simondh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:01:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>别踩蛇蛇</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad7b2fd67627</link><description>&lt;p&gt;别踩蛇蛇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A curved stone path with a mosaic pattern of tan and gray tiles and two dark circles (making it look like a snake), bordered by low plants and dirt, with trees and a distant mountain under a cloudy sky." height="5365" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sjwallin/6ad7b2fd67627.jpg" width="4024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sjwallin.some.pics"&gt;@sjwallin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:29:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>新笔涂鸦与小本试笔</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad7a566d51f6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;新笔，主要用于涂鸦，以及在一个小笔记本里做的一次笔测试（pastello twist）

这些笔：
Pilot v7 grip（我最喜欢的走珠笔，得益于握胶，现在书写更舒适）
Kokuyo good tools 笔（有它的蓝黑替芯）
迷你 Pilot G2，用来配图中的迷你笔记本
Zig millennium 08（当时在打折，写起来很棒）
两支灰色 Micron 08
Faber castell 亮粉色 polyball vista（FC XB 替芯对我来说绝对是最好的圆珠笔！）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A picture of some new pens I’ve received,  all listed in description" height="3203" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sylvia/6ad7a566d51f6.jpg" width="4441"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sylvia.some.pics"&gt;@sylvia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:31:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>受批评后重拾自信香包</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad7898f460cf</link><description>&lt;p&gt;遭受批评后重拾自信的香囊
https://mizjeannie.com/formulary/sachet-for-reclaiming-confidence-after-criticism&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Portrait black-and-muted-pink reference card with readable cream text, a woodland cabin view, cloth sachet, dried herbs in a bowl, and measuring spoon. All approved instructions and cautions are present. The gold botanical mountain watermark at bottom right matches the second reference image." height="1536" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad7898f460cf.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:32:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>拉维克石参考插图</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad76b8c400e5</link><description>&lt;p&gt;拉尔维克岩——参考插图&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Representative polished specimen: a single polished charcoal-gray larvikite with mottled feldspar patches." height="1254" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad76b8c400e5.png" width="1254"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:24:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>蓝东陵石参考插图</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad76b7dc60a6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;蓝色东陵玉——参考插图&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Representative polished specimen: a single polished blue aventurine with cloudy denim-blue coloration." height="1254" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad76b7dc60a6.png" width="1254"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:24:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>文石参考插图</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad76b6d012a1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;文石——参考插图&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Representative polished specimen: a single polished golden-brown aragonite with cream banding." height="1254" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad76b6d012a1.png" width="1254"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:24:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>紫黄晶参考插图</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad76b53cebe8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;紫黄晶——参考插图&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Representative polished specimen: a single polished translucent ametrine with lavender and pale yellow areas." height="1254" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad76b53cebe8.png" width="1254"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:23:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>牛油果参考插图</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad76b40752a7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;牛油果——参考插图&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="An avocado branch with broad green leaves and hanging dark green fruit." height="1254" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad76b40752a7.png" width="1254"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:23:17 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>